Patch 2040: d3d12: RSX sRGB colour output (SHADER_PACKER), the output half of that port d95db3c (SRGB_OUT=0 off)

Source: output half of that port's toolkit d95db3c.

Re-fitted for v0.19.0: Cube-mask loop over all 16 units, as before.

